  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3306.03 Additional Monitoring Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3306.03 Additional Monitoring Requirements. The owner or operator of a small MWC unit shall comply with the following monitoring requirements:\n\n(a) 40 CFR § 60.1805;\n\n(b) 40 CFR § 60.1810;\n\n(c) 40 CFR § 60.1815;\n\n(d) 40 CFR § 60.1820; and\n\n(e) 40 CFR § 60.1825.\n\nSource. #7704, eff 6-7-02; ss by #9084, eff 2-2-08; ss by #11131, eff 7-18-16; ss by #12628, eff 9-27-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3300.html"
